    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 206,
      "bottomRightX": 378,
      "bottomRightY": 278,
      "content": "LV-DOS (LV-ROM, Data grabber, CPU) communicates with the player via the UPI-41 RS232 interface using F-Codes. The connector for this local UART interface is W4. The UPI-41 operates via 4 internal registers, input, output, control and status. The registers are addressed by A0 with -IORD or -IORW.",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
